    forge["Forge (data ops)"]:::system
    mimir["Mimir (local AI, Mistral Small 3.2)"]:::system
    bifrost["Bifrost (delivery)"]:::system
    heimdall["Heimdall (fusion)"]:::system
    src["External data sources\n(DBs, APIs, files, feeds)"]:::external
    idp["Enterprise IdP\n(OIDC/SAML, optional)"]:::external
    hsm["HSM / TPM\n(key sealing)"]:::external

    analyst -->|HTTPS+PQ| midgard
    admin -->|HTTPS+PQ| midgard
    dev -->|SDK/CLI| midgard
    forge --> midgard
    mimir --> midgard
